## Import

Import existing resource

### Using Import block (terraform v1.5.0 and later)
```terraform
import {
  to = stackguardian_policy.require_environment_tag
  id = "require-environment-tag"
}
```

### Using CLI
```bash
terraform import stackguardian_policy.require_environment_tag require-environment-tag
```

## Building this with AI

